    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE WHAT YOU EAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In <i>UDLR</i>, your four directions of movement correspond with four different inventory slots: Up, Down, Left, and Right. Pick up an item on your left side, and now that item's ability will be used every time you move left! This simple premise is explored in depth, with many items and mechanical surprises to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/extras/51fee4fcf21f9b324532fcf093c5bb6f.poster.avif?t=1746830698\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/extras/51fee4fcf21f9b324532fcf093c5bb6f.webm?t=1746830698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/extras/51fee4fcf21f9b324532fcf093c5bb6f.mp4?t=1746830698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ puzzles with a wide range of difficulty</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bespoke art for every puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Language-agnostic hints for every puzzle</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorblind accessible by default</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Option to unlock all levels at any time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/extras/1a9ad018d7e54f0c1d1e2ca421292e8e.poster.avif?t=1746830698\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/extras/1a9ad018d7e54f0c1d1e2ca421292e8e.webm?t=1746830698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/extras/1a9ad018d7e54f0c1d1e2ca421292e8e.mp4?t=1746830698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT ABOUT UDLR_MODIFY?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>UDLR_Modify</i> was originally created for the Acerola Jam 0 as a prototype with 20 puzzles, where it was among the most popular  games submitted. <i>UDLR</i> is the full-length follow up to that game, keeping the best puzzles from the original while adding many more, adding new item types, and modifying some of the base mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/extras/ccd9aad1329926bb5aaa3fa1f00cee29.poster.avif?t=1746830698\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/extras/ccd9aad1329926bb5aaa3fa1f00cee29.webm?t=1746830698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/extras/ccd9aad1329926bb5aaa3fa1f00cee29.mp4?t=1746830698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE WHAT YOU EAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In <i>UDLR</i>, your four directions of movement correspond with four different inventory slots: Up, Down, Left, and Right. Pick up an item on your left side, and now that item's ability will be used every time you move left! This simple premise is explored in depth, with many items and mechanical surprises to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/extras/51fee4fcf21f9b324532fcf093c5bb6f.poster.avif?t=1746830698\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/extras/51fee4fcf21f9b324532fcf093c5bb6f.webm?t=1746830698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/extras/51fee4fcf21f9b324532fcf093c5bb6f.mp4?t=1746830698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ puzzles with a wide range of difficulty</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bespoke art for every puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Language-agnostic hints for every puzzle</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorblind accessible by default</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Option to unlock all levels at any time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/extras/1a9ad018d7e54f0c1d1e2ca421292e8e.poster.avif?t=1746830698\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/extras/1a9ad018d7e54f0c1d1e2ca421292e8e.webm?t=1746830698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/extras/1a9ad018d7e54f0c1d1e2ca421292e8e.mp4?t=1746830698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT ABOUT UDLR_MODIFY?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>UDLR_Modify</i> was originally created for the Acerola Jam 0 as a prototype with 20 puzzles, where it was among the most popular  games submitted. <i>UDLR</i> is the full-length follow up to that game, keeping the best puzzles from the original while adding many more, adding new item types, and modifying some of the base mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/extras/ccd9aad1329926bb5aaa3fa1f00cee29.poster.avif?t=1746830698\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/extras/ccd9aad1329926bb5aaa3fa1f00cee29.webm?t=1746830698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191170/extras/ccd9aad1329926bb5aaa3fa1f00cee29.mp4?t=1746830698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
